  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Secluded Library</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Faction sphere (safe house, travel papers)</p>\n<p>You may have your safe house take a mobile form such as a caravan, a large ship, or other form of transportation that your faction could provide through the travel papers talent. This mobile safe house is secured in the same way as a normal safe house, covers the same total area, and benefits from any talents that improve your safe house (such as Assured Lifestyle and Restful Refuge).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/faction#toc60\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
